  'Welcome to your 40-day journey. Each day, you’ll find a gentle prompt to help you pause, reflect, and write down your thoughts. This journal isn’t about “right” or “wrong” answers — it’s about your heart, your experiences, and your growing connection with Allah. Think of it as a conversation between you and yourself, a safe space to capture what’s stirring inside you. No biases, no judgments, just an honest deep connection with yourself and your Creator.',
