export const ABOUT_AUTHOR =
  'Nur Faiza Ayala Binti Abdullah (Jurela Ayala) is a university lecturer, public speaker, and certified group life coach who possesses a deep, lifelong passion for writing and sharing knowledge. In September 2025, while standing at a major crossroads in her life, her meticulous research led her to the beautiful truth of Islam. Prior to her transition to Islam, she served as a passionate educator and dedicated preacher and had extensive hands-on experience in church-planting and administration. Because she intimately understands the emotional, spiritual, and social shifts that come with choosing a new path, she proposed and poured her heart into creating this 40-day journal as a gentle sanctuary for new Muslims. Today, she blends her professional background in coaching and education with her personal journey of faith to help reverts feel deeply seen, sheltered, and loved as they take their very first steps with the Hidayah Centre Foundation.';

